# Only what the image is built from: a .venv, a cache, a database or a
# stray credential in the checkout never reaches the builder.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!packages/*/pyproject.toml
!packages/*/src
!web
!web/package.json
!web/pnpm-lock.yaml
!web/pnpm-workspace.yaml
# A checkout's own dependencies, test output and client build stay out: the
# image builds the client from the lock.
web/node_modules
web/test-results
web/playwright-report
packages/vantage/src/vantage/service/client
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
